{"id":1010501,"chapter_id":1010501,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"自西区的一系列冲突事件结束后，时间已经过去了9个月。","style":3,"background":960,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"这九个月来，曾经充斥着混乱与暴力的“辛迪加”走上了正轨。","style":3,"background":960,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"新城对这位一衣带水邻居的态度也逐渐转变，理解与合作似乎正在成为新的风向。","style":3,"background":946,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"当然，这期间。狄斯城也并非全无波澜。暗网的出现与肆虐成为了新的焦点问题。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"4月 灰镜投票事件 超过两千人感染狂厄症状。其中约一百五十人精神遭遇重创，至今无法治愈。","style":3,"background":4287,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"6月 极乐岛事件 十余人失踪，近三百人被波及，造成极为恶劣的社会影响。","style":3,"background":4308,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"依靠暗网本身的隐蔽性，这上半年以来集中爆发的系列事件一度成为狄斯城热议的焦点。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"所幸的是，在MBCC的主导下，隶属涅槃的网络安全中心找到了防御暗网侵袭的手段。自6月以来，暗网再无大的动作。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"安宁与稳定，始终是这九个月来狄斯城的绝对主旋律。这几次“小小”的事件并不构成实质威胁，充其量不过是久违平静中的不和谐插曲——至少绝大多数狄斯人是这么认为的。","style":3,"background":2217,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"只不过，你并不在此列。","style":3,"background":2217,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"■月■日\n22:41","style":9,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"和平的7月已然翻篇，月底短假的尾声，你告别了赫卡蒂、艾米潘和雷比尼斯，回到办公室，重新投入了工作当中。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"叮咚——","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"新邮件提醒亮起。你扫了一眼发件人：“涅槃网络安全中心”，随即点开。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"2分钟后，你长长地舒了一口气。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您看起来心情不错，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"夜莺走入办公室，将咖啡杯端到了你手边。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是暗网的调查有进展了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"是的。网安那边回复了，说会派人过来协助——就是上次极乐岛事件帮忙的那个技术员，据说是暗网方面的专家。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"禁闭者摩尔……我记得她。近几次与暗网相关的事件她都很活跃，的确是最好的外援人选。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"你点点头，端起咖啡杯啜了一口，新换的这款不知名咖啡豆香气异常浓郁。你感到精神一振。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"邮件上说她明天一早就到。我来安排会议室吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"麻烦你了。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"夜莺瞥了一眼你手中已然见底的咖啡杯，微微笑着：","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"需要再来一杯吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"options":["好的","不了"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501026,"trial_step":26,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"好的","goto":27},{"text":"不了","goto":29}]},{"step":27,"content":"你很自然地将杯子递过去，目送夜莺离开。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"但愿这些咖啡能让你支撑到明天早上。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501028,"trial_step":28,"next":[31]},{"step":29,"content":"你瞥了一眼墙上的时钟，考虑到明天一早就要和那位技术专家见面，拒绝了再来一杯咖啡的提议。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"近两个月的“和平”让你养成了准时下班的好习惯——该收工了。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501030,"trial_step":30,"next":[31]},{"step":31,"content":"■月■日\n8:27\nMBCC4号会议室","style":9,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"你刚一进入会议室，就见到了一位意料之外的客人。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"熟悉的灰色外套和宽檐帽——毫无疑问，眼前这个人来自第九机关。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……？","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"男人露出标志性的笑容，向你脱帽致意。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"你和第九机关早有默契，在一来一去的眼神中，完成了大部分的“交流”。所以在开口时，便已省去了所有无用的寒暄，只剩下一个简单的问题：","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那个人有问题？","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"9th人员","content":"只是怀疑——您知道的，这是我们的本职工作。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"9th人员","content":"当然，您不用被这种怀疑干扰，做您应该做的就好。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"你点点头，结束了这段简短的谈话。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"事情变得微妙起来。你对那位未曾谋面的禁闭者产生了一丝兴趣——以往值得第九机关“怀疑”的人，可都不简单。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"接下来，就是等她到了。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"10:35\nMBCC4号会议室","style":9,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"时间逐渐流逝。沉默萦绕在会议室中，你甚至能看到有工作人员在会议室角落里打起了哈欠。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"不知不觉，距离约定好的时间已经过去了两个小时。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"抱歉，刚刚网络安全中心发来消息，摩尔还需要一段时间才能抵达。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"好。","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"你也没闲着，向夜莺要了杯咖啡，在会议室里处理起公务来。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"12:01\nMBCC4号会议室","style":9,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"咖啡早已喝完，能够在会议室里处理的公务也都已处理完毕。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"需要再来杯咖啡么？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……不用了。","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"就算是再怎么好喝的咖啡，连喝4杯也有些反胃了。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"13:01\nMBCC4号会议室","style":9,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"距离约定的会议时间已经过去了四个半小时，你实在是坐不住了，开始思考要不要先离开会议室去吃个饭之类的问题。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"就在这时，会议室的门被推开，菲的头探了进来。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"菲","content":"你们还在呀？会开完了么？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……没有，人还没来齐。","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"菲","content":"嘶……可是我下午约了后勤部门的老大在这里聊事情诶。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"options":["我去联络下网安吧。"],"style":6,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501061,"trial_step":61,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我去联络下网安吧。","goto":62}]},{"step":62,"content":"你缓缓站起身，揉了揉因久坐而酸痛异常的后背。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"或许是在路上出了什么事，不行的话就推迟今天的……","style":2,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"铃铃铃——","style":11,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"工作人员","content":"暴徒们已经追到了这边，被你们的动静吸引，叫嚣着冲了过来。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":11,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"？？","content":"十、十分抱歉…………","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"？？","content":"我是、摩尔……真的、不好意思局长……我来晚了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"提着巨大电脑箱的女性身材纤弱，从楼下到这个二楼会议室至多也就30米路程，却已让她不住喘气。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"本来是该早上坐……坐单位班车来的，但是昨天晚上加班太晚了。早上回到家想着小睡一会儿来着，没想到直接睡死过去了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"说着，摩尔拖着手提箱挪到了你跟前。随着气息平复，她的脸色也稍微好看了些。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"那个……我们现在就开始会议吧？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"你转过头看向门口，菲和几个一脸懵逼的后勤部门官员也同时看向了你。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"工作人员","content":"呃局长，下午的会议室都已经订满了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"似乎是在有意找补，摩尔居然主动拖着手提箱走到会议室外，四下张望了一会儿。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"那边不是还有房间空着吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"你看向摩尔手指的方向。那是一间——","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"审查室。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"刚一进门，摩尔就很自然地坐在了椅子上，略微调整坐姿后，脸上的睡意迅速蔓延开来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1010501},{"step":79,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"感觉……哈欠……又有点困了……好想再补个觉啊……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1010503},{"step":80,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1010503},{"step":81,"options":["给摩尔来杯咖啡"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501083,"trial_step":83,"course":3,"drawing":1010503,"choices":[{"text":"给摩尔来杯咖啡","goto":84}]},{"step":82,"content":"一杯热腾腾的咖啡杯被端到了摩尔面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1010503},{"step":83,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"欸，给我的？谢谢……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1010504},{"step":84,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"唔……哇，好香……和我以前喝的都不一样……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1010504},{"step":85,"content":"一口咖啡下肚，刚刚还困倦茫然的眼睛便渐渐恢复了神采。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1010501},{"step":86,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"清醒了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1010501},{"step":87,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"哎呀，完全睡迷糊了呢，不仅差点错过了重要的会议，还要在审查室里睡觉，真是丢脸啊……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1010502},{"step":88,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……总而言之，既然清醒了，我们还是快点进入正题吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1010502},{"step":89,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"哦哦好，差点把这个给忘了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1010501},{"step":90,"content":"摩尔拽起手提箱放在桌上。巨大的黑色匣子被打开，里面一层层堆叠着数个显示屏幕。她依次将这些屏幕全都展开，如同墙壁一样，将自己包裹其中。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1010501},{"step":91,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我能找到的所有关于暗网的资料，都在这里了。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1010501},{"step":92,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这是……？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1010501},{"step":93,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是我的工作站。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1010502},{"step":94,"content":"摩尔抬起头朝你笑了笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1010502},{"step":95,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"15块超级芯片交互拼出来的高级货，搭载了便携式服务器，无论处理数据还是作为信息攻防基站都非常可靠。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1010502},{"step":96,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我从来没见别人用过，这是你的能力？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1010501},{"step":97,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"啊？不是不是，这是我自己动手改造的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1010504},{"step":98,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我的禁闭者能力比这个复杂，而且很抽象，平时不太能用得到。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1010501},{"step":99,"content":"说着，工作站完成了启动，摩尔开始在键盘上飞快输入指令。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1010501},{"step":100,"content":"摩尔没有继续解释自己禁闭者相关的情况，不知道是否是在刻意隐瞒。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1010501},{"step":101,"options":["那你……是怎么成为禁闭者的？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501103,"trial_step":103,"course":3,"drawing":1010501,"choices":[{"text":"那你……是怎么成为禁闭者的？","goto":104}]},{"step":102,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"唔……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1010501},{"step":103,"content":"你试探性地抛出了问题。摩尔的目光陷入短暂游离，似乎是在思考，不过手上的动作倒是没停下。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1010503},{"step":104,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是因为暗网啦。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1010501},{"step":105,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"暗网？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1010501},{"step":106,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我记得网安很早就配备了屏蔽数据化狂厄的设备……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1010501},{"step":107,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"不是今年。我112年就开始调查暗网了。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1010501},{"step":108,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这么早？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1010501},{"step":109,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯……有很多原因吧。而且作为技术员，很难不对暗网感兴趣。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1010501},{"step":110,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"既是难缠的对手，同时也包罗了普通人一辈子都接触不到的庞大信息。无论是罪恶、秘密，还是世界的真相，好像都能藏在里面。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1010501},{"step":111,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"从那时候开始我就一直在研究，等反应过来的时候，身体已经受到了影响，高烧昏迷了好几天……醒过来的时候就变成禁闭者了。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1010501},{"step":112,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这么说，你还是最早的那批暗网症患者？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1010501},{"step":113,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是的，环研院还找过我。就连暗网症的定义都有我参与呢。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1010502},{"step":114,"options":["看来网安把你派来确实没错"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501116,"trial_step":116,"course":3,"drawing":1010501,"choices":[{"text":"看来网安把你派来确实没错","goto":117}]},{"step":115,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯，专业领域方面的内容我还是有一些自信的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1010501},{"step":116,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"就是专业领域外的事情让人有些不敢恭维。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1010501},{"step":117,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"啊哈哈……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1010502},{"step":118,"content":"摩尔显然也知道这一点，有些不好意思地笑了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1010502},{"step":119,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那你平时是怎么生活。有家人照顾吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1010501},{"step":120,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"家人？严格来说没有吧……我小学毕业之后父母就离开了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1010501},{"step":121,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"为什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1010501},{"step":122,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"唔……时间过去太久，记不清了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1010505},{"step":123,"content":"不知道是她不愿提起，还是真不记得了，但只从表情来看的话，倒不像是在撒谎。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1010505},{"step":124,"content":"你看着她忙忙碌碌地按下最后一个按键，抬起头笑着看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1010502},{"step":125,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"好啦，现有暗网的全部资料我都整理好了。附件太大了走不了邮箱，要不我直接传到你们管理局的主机里去？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1010502},{"step":126,"content":"作为技术员的摩尔效率的确惊人。一边应付你的试探和诘问，一边已经完成了手头的工作。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1010501},{"step":127,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"有劳了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1010501},{"step":128,"content":"你点点头，摩尔也伸手准备按下确认键。只不过，在按下前的那一刻，她停下了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1010501},{"step":129,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1010506},{"step":130,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我想了想，在把资料传过去之前，我还有一件事想要跟你确认。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1010506},{"step":131,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"什么事？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1010506},{"step":132,"content":"摩尔的手从键盘处收回，放在了膝盖上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1010501},{"step":133,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"就如我刚才所说的，暗网能够通过网络，散播数据化狂厄……在这个时代，网络早已无处不在、无可替代。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1010501},{"step":134,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"暗网也因此潜伏在了每个人的身边。每一个身处网络中的人都会受到它的监视，任何威胁都是它攻击的目标。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1010501},{"step":135,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"但在过去，不是没有人试图调查过暗网。结果就是，他们中的绝大多数都死了……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1010506},{"step":136,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1010506},{"step":137,"content":"你愕然，这情报你此前从未听说过。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1010506},{"step":138,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你会有这种反应也很正常啦，毕竟暗网的手段是很隐蔽的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1010502},{"step":139,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"平时一直在用的终端忽然有一天变成了炸飞脑袋的炸弹；平时一直收听的电台夹杂了奇怪的东西，让人精神失常跳楼……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1010502},{"step":140,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"甚至有人把自己关在断了网的密室，第二天才发现被活活烤死在房间里——暗网控制了房屋管道，将这个房间变成了巨大的烤炉。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1010502},{"step":141,"content":"在描述这些堪称猎奇的“死亡”时，摩尔的笑容始终没有变过，","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1010502},{"step":142,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你真的……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1010502},{"step":143,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"做好面对它的准备了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1010501},{"step":144,"options":["是的"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501146,"trial_step":146,"course":3,"drawing":1010501,"choices":[{"text":"是的","goto":147}]},{"step":145,"content":"没有犹豫，你给出了答复。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1010501},{"step":146,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"网安遏制暗网只是暂时的，我不觉得这样就够了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1010501},{"step":147,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我想要的，是将这个毒瘤连根拔起。不能让它再……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1010501},{"step":148,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1010504},{"step":149,"content":"紧接着几秒后，灯光重新亮起，只不过，是预示着管理局遇袭的警戒红光。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1010504},{"step":150,"speaker":"警报","content":"警报！异常超载！核心压力上升。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1010506},{"step":151,"speaker":"警报","content":"检测到数据化狂厄袭击！切断所有数据化通讯手段！A2-B16区域的人员，请立即前往……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1010506},{"step":152,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局……您在……远离……爆……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1010506},{"step":153,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"喂？夜莺？夜莺！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1010506},{"step":154,"content":"你腾地一下站起身，可终端里只剩下了无数杂音。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1010506},{"step":155,"content":"代表着危险的红光不住闪烁。你来不及解释，而是一把拽起摩尔，想要带着她尽快逃离审查室。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1010506},{"step":156,"content":"可下一刻，一堵奇异的光墙却环绕在你们两人身边。摩尔的手，轻柔而坚决地按住了你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1010506},{"step":157,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"别害怕。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1010502},{"step":158,"content":"伴随着她扬起的双手，环绕在她身旁的屏幕如同羽翼般迅速展开。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1010502},{"step":159,"content":"在青蓝与鲜红交叠辉映的荧荧光亮下，此刻的摩尔，身处由光编织成的重重罗网当中，仿佛抬手便能操纵一切。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1010502},{"step":160,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"交给我吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1010502},{"step":161,"content":"你看着摩尔在你眼前，却无法理解她在做什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1010501},{"step":162,"content":"随着她的手指如演奏乐曲般跳动，一个个字段在屏幕上飞速掠过，刷新的频率已然完全超越了人眼能够跟上的速度。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1010501},{"step":163,"content":"炫目的数据攻防在那看不见的战场当中激烈地展开着，摩尔的脸上却始终挂着不变的笑容。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1010501},{"step":164,"content":"仅仅过去数十秒，工作站的屏幕停止了跳动，画面定格在了十几个坐标上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1010501},{"step":165,"content":"与此同时，警报声戛然而止。短暂的等待后，管理局的照明系统也恢复了正常。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501168,"trial_step":168,"course":7,"drawing":1010501},{"step":166,"content":"摩尔转过头，笑吟吟地看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1010502},{"step":167,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"参与袭击的黑客共计14人，我已经定位具体坐标，并且反向控制了他们的机器。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1010502},{"step":168,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"都是些杂牌军，正主不在里面……怎么样，要去抓捕吗？还是直接杀掉就好？","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1010506},{"step":169,"content":"摩尔的发言让你一个激灵，赶紧给出了答复。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1010506},{"step":170,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"坐标发给行动部门，让他们去处理吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1010506},{"step":171,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"好的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_174"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1010501},{"step":172,"content":"摩尔简单敲击几下键盘之后便关闭了工作站。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1010501},{"step":173,"content":"光幕、汹涌的数据都已消失不见，仿佛刚刚那番凶险的数据攻防从未发生过。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1010501},{"step":174,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"啊对了，这次信息攻防暴露了MBCC的163处防御漏洞，我都给你堵上了，顺带给你升级了新一代的防火墙。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_177"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501177,"trial_step":177},{"step":175,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"那么我就先去做暗网的攻略准备啦。拜拜，局长~","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_178"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501178,"trial_step":178},{"step":176,"content":"摩尔朝你挥挥手，在工作人员的带领下离开这一层，去到了属于她的房间。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501179,"trial_step":179},{"step":177,"content":"摩尔离开后，不远处的第九机关成员也朝你脱帽致意，留下一个意味深长的笑容后，消失在楼梯的转角。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501180,"trial_step":180},{"step":178,"content":"不一会儿，夜莺来到你跟前，开始汇报起刚刚发生的事情。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501181,"trial_step":181},{"step":179,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我们的数据防御系统遭到了多股不明数据流攻击，他们篡改了管理局中枢权限，并且对能量核心发出了非法的超载指令。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501182,"trial_step":182},{"step":180,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"紧接着……就是您看到的，禁闭者摩尔接手防御，在1分15秒内解决了袭击。由于她的迅速反应，管理局没有受到实质性损失。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_183"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501183,"trial_step":183},{"step":181,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"10分钟前，根据她传给我们的坐标信息，行动部门出动，目前已有5名参与袭击的黑客被抓获……","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_184"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501184,"trial_step":184},{"step":182,"content":"听着夜莺的汇报，你有些无奈地揉了揉眉心。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501185,"trial_step":185},{"step":183,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我们的技术部门……和摩尔的差距有这么大吗？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501186,"trial_step":186},{"step":184,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……是的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_187"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501187,"trial_step":187},{"step":185,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"她展现出了压倒性的技术力。在数字安全领域，恐怕整个狄斯城都找不出几个能和她抗衡的。","voice":["vo_trial_10501_1_188"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501188,"trial_step":188},{"step":186,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这么一看，摩尔的确适合委以重任……","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501189,"trial_step":189},{"step":187,"content":"话说到一半，回想起第九机关的怀疑，加上摩尔今天谈话也还有所隐瞒，你停下了。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501190,"trial_step":190},{"step":188,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……再观察一下，借这次行动看看她的立场。也算是给第九机关一个交代。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110501191,"trial_step":191}]}